---
// Lynik Innovations — homepage concept (client pitch mockup)
// Photo slots use .photo-block placeholders — swap in licensed photography
// (or the client's real founder headshots) before this goes live.
import './pharm-consult.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Lynik Innovations — Home (Concept)</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap"
  />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <header class="nav">
      <div class="wrap nav-row">
        <div class="wordmark-row">
          <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
          <div class="wordmark">
            <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
            <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult" class="active">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about">About</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help">Who We Help</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold nav-cta">Let's Talk</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="wrap hero-row">
        <div class="hero">
          <span class="eyebrow">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
          <h1>Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</h1>
          <p class="lede2">Medical Information expertise that helps life sciences companies prepare, launch, and grow. Lynik Innovations provides experienced Medical Information consulting for pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies that need to build capabilities, strengthen operations, prepare for launch, or bring additional expertise to their teams.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Let's Discuss Your Needs</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services" class="btn btn-line">Explore Our Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media">
          <div class="photo-block">
            <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12.5" r="3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 6l1.2-2h5.6L16 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
            <span class="cap">Photo — consultant portrait, office setting</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-caption">
            Strategic Support.<br/>Real-World Solutions.
            <div class="rule"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">ARE YOU READY?</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">Your product is moving forward. Is your Medical Information function ready?</h2>
        <p class="lede">As pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies prepare for launch or enter new stages of growth, Medical Information requirements can evolve quickly. You may need to:</p>
        <div class="problem-grid">
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Build or strengthen an MI function</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Support increasing inquiry volume</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Prepare for product launch</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Train internal or outsourced MI teams</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Develop Medical Information resources</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Improve operational efficiency</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Establish inquiry and escalation workflows</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Implement appropriate AI-enabled workflows</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Improve literature search and evaluation processes</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Provide experienced interim or fractional MI leadership</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="bridge">Lynik Innovations helps bridge those gaps.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">Practical Expertise. Strategic Support.</h2>
        <div class="card-grid cols-4">

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — lab glassware</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><path d="M6 5h13a3 3 0 013 3v15H9a3 3 0 01-3-3V5z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M11 11h8M11 15.5h8M11 20h5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Medical Information</h3>
              <p>Build, strengthen, and optimize Medical Information capabilities.</p>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — launch document, pen</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><path d="M15 4c4 3 6 7.5 6 12.5 0 2-.4 3.6-1 5H10c-.6-1.4-1-3-1-5C9 11.5 11 7 15 4z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="13" r="2.4" fill="var(--sage)"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Launch Readiness</h3>
              <p>Prepare Medical Information operations and resources for successful product launches.</p>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — team meeting</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="9" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="9" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M3 22c0-3.5 2.3-5.5 5-5.5S13 18.5 13 22M17 22c0-3.5 2.3-5.5 5-5.5S27 18.5 27 22" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Medical Affairs &amp; Operations</h3>
              <p>Support processes, workflows, content, training, metrics, and cross-functional operations.</p>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--forest) 0%,var(--forest-2) 100%)">
                <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="21" r="3" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M10.5 9.5L13 18.5M19.5 9.5L17 18.5M11 8h8" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
                <span class="cap" style="color:var(--sage)">AI network illustration</span>
              </div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="21" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M10.5 9.5L13 18.5M19.5 9.5L17 18.5M11 8h8" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>AI-Enabled Medical Information</h3>
              <p>Help MI teams thoughtfully incorporate AI into literature searching, evaluation, and summarization&mdash;with appropriate human oversight.</p>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHY LYNIK</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">More Than Consulting. Experienced Medical Information Leadership.</h2>
        <div class="row-grid row-5">

          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><path d="M10.5 3h5v6l4.5 9a2 2 0 01-1.8 2.9H7.8A2 2 0 016 17.9L10.5 9V3z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 15h8" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Scientific Expertise</h3>
            <p>PharmD-level scientific knowledge and pharmaceutical Medical Information experience.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="6.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M13 3v3M13 20v3M3 13h3M20 13h3M6 6l2 2M18 18l2 2M20 6l-2 2M8 18l-2 2" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Operational Experience</h3>
            <p>Hands-on understanding of MI workflows, inquiries, resources, escalation, training, and vendor operations.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><path d="M13 4c4 3 6 7 6 11.5 0 1.8-.4 3.3-1 4.5h-10c-.6-1.2-1-2.7-1-4.5C7 11 9 7 13 4z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="13" cy="12" r="2.2" fill="var(--sage)"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Launch Experience</h3>
            <p>Practical support for companies preparing their Medical Information function for product launch.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="8" width="10" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M13 3v5M13 18v5M3 13h5M18 13h5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="1.8" fill="var(--sage)"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Technology &amp; AI Awareness</h3>
            <p>Identifying practical opportunities to use AI to improve efficiency while maintaining scientific review.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="13" r="7" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="13" r="7" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Cross-Functional Perspective</h3>
            <p>Understanding how Medical Information works alongside Medical Affairs, Regulatory, Safety, and Compliance.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">WHEN YOU MIGHT NEED US</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">When Does Your Organization Need Medical Information Support?</h2>
        <div class="row-grid row-5">

          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle on-dark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3c3.2 2.4 4.8 6 4.8 10 0 1.6-.3 2.9-.8 4H8c-.5-1.1-.8-2.4-.8-4 0-4 1.6-7.6 4.8-10z" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Preparing for a Launch?</h3>
            <p>Get your MI infrastructure, resources, workflows, and team ready before demand increases.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle on-dark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V13l5-3v11M9 21V6l5-3v18M14 21v-8l6-3v11" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Building an MI Function?</h3>
            <p>Establish practical processes and capabilities that can grow with your organization.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle on-dark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="7.5" r="3.5" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5 21c0-4.4 3.1-7 7-7s7 2.6 7 7" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Need Interim Leadership?</h3>
            <p>Bring in experienced support while recruiting or transitioning to a permanent team.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle on-dark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="14" width="4.5" height="7" fill="var(--gold)"/><rect x="9.75" y="9" width="4.5" height="12" fill="var(--gold)"/><rect x="16.5" y="4" width="4.5" height="17" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Team at Capacity?</h3>
            <p>Add experienced expertise without expanding headcount as volume and complexity increase.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle on-dark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20 8a8 8 0 10.6 6" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M20 3v5h-5" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Looking to Modernize MI?</h3>
            <p>Identify opportunities to improve workflows, knowledge management, and AI adoption.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <div class="photo-block" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sage-tint) 0%,var(--sage-tint-2) 55%,var(--sage-line) 100%)">
            <span class="cap">Photo &mdash; office plants / desk detail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="overlay">
            <div class="box">
              <h2>Let's Talk About What Your Organization Needs.</h2>
              <p>Whether you're preparing for launch, building your Medical Information function, strengthening existing operations, or exploring responsible AI implementation, Lynik Innovations can help you determine the right next step.</p>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Start a Conversation</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="footer-top">
          <div class="wordmark-row">
            <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
            <div class="wordmark">
              <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
              <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <nav class="footer-nav">
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about">About</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help">Who We Help</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="footer-contact">
            <span>info@lynikinnovations.com</span>
            <div class="social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="3" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="7.2" cy="7.2" r="1.1" fill="rgba(247,245,239,.7)"/><path d="M6.2 10.5v7.3M10.4 10.5v7.3M10.4 13.6c0-1.8 1.2-3.1 2.9-3.1s2.7 1.1 2.7 3.3v4" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <span>&copy; 2026 Lynik Innovations. All rights reserved.</span>
          <span>Madison, Wisconsin</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>